\contentsline {table}{\numberline {8.8}{\ignorespaces Comprehensive comparison of all uncertainty quantification methods investigated. The ``Gap to 90\%'' column quantifies the calibration shortfall relative to the nominal 90\% coverage target. Training times reflect wall-clock duration on a single machine with Apple Silicon (M1). Methods are ordered by their underlying approach: single-output BNN variants (rows 1-4), non-Bayesian baselines (rows 5-6), and architectural innovation (row 7).}}{195}{table.caption.967}%
\contentsline {table}{\numberline {8.9}{\ignorespaces Phase 1: Feature Ablation Study for BNN Calibration}}{195}{table.caption.973}%
\contentsline {table}{\numberline {8.10}{\ignorespaces Bayesian Neural Network Prior Sensitivity Analysis}}{196}{table.caption.987}%
